      "height": 16.25,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "patient-level, never by sample — assert_no_leakage() runs on every split. slices are keyed by patient id, so slices of one case never straddle a split.",
      "originalText": "patient-level, never by sample — assert_no_leakage() runs on every split. slices are keyed by patient id, so slices of one case never straddle a split.",
