      "height": 105.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "PIXEL PATH — data/slices.py   on-disk slice cache\n\ncache/index.json · cache/cases/<pid>.npy → (n_slices, 4, H, W) float16 memmap, opened lazily\none file per case: the count is unknown until the stream ends, and buffering to stack at\nthe end would need ~9 GB for full BraTS — the exact problem the cache exists to solve\n\nslice selection is LABEL-FREE (geometric | brain_area) — may look at the image, never the mask",
      "originalText": "PIXEL PATH — data/slices.py   on-disk slice cache\n\ncache/index.json · cache/cases/<pid>.npy → (n_slices, 4, H, W) float16 memmap, opened lazily\none file per case: the count is unknown until the stream ends, and buffering to stack at\nthe end would need ~9 GB for full BraTS — the exact problem the cache exists to solve\n\nslice selection is LABEL-FREE (geometric | brain_area) — may look at the image, never the mask",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
