      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "torch experts: one shared backbone, five linear heads (2,2,3,3,3), summed cross-entropy — 108 joint classes would be mostly unobserved here.\n2.5-D: trained per slice, averaged to case level. AP-flip augmentation only — an LR flip would mirror the hemisphere and invert `laterality`.",
      "originalText": "torch experts: one shared backbone, five linear heads (2,2,3,3,3), summed cross-entropy — 108 joint classes would be mostly unobserved here.\n2.5-D: trained per slice, averaged to case level. AP-flip augmentation only — an LR flip would mirror the hemisphere and invert `laterality`.",
