      "id": "t124",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1395.8,
      "y": 277.5,
      "width": 428.4,
      "height": 210.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "run.py\n\n--experts surrogate | torch      expert family\n--protocol stratified            random split\n--protocol external              hold out a COHORT\n\nuse external for BraTS 2021 → BraTS-Africa:\n~29 test cases cannot resolve a 0.03 AURC effect\n\nevery run records the family under \"experts\" in its\nJSON — the two are NOT interchangeable as evidence,\nand the difference is invisible in the numbers",
      "originalText": "run.py\n\n--experts surrogate | torch      expert family\n--protocol stratified            random split\n--protocol external              hold out a COHORT\n\nuse external for BraTS 2021 → BraTS-Africa:\n~29 test cases cannot resolve a 0.03 AURC effect\n\nevery run records the family under \"experts\" in its\nJSON — the two are NOT interchangeable as evidence,\nand the difference is invisible in the numbers",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r123",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "roundness": null
    },
