      "id": "t126",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1366.4,
      "y": 606.25,
      "width": 487.2,
      "height": 262.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "ablations.py — the grid\n\nB0  single expert, raw softmax      uncalibrated floor\nB1  + temperature scaling          post-hoc calibration\nB2  MC dropout                     uncertainty by sampling\nB3  homogeneous 3× ensemble        ENSEMBLING alone\nB4  heterogeneous, uniform         HETEROGENEITY (vs B3)\nB5  heterogeneous, confidence-wt   self-reported conf.\nB6  heterogeneous, quality-routed  ROUTING (vs B4/B5)\n\neach row adds exactly one factor to the row above\n\nB2 is genuine MC dropout under --experts torch (dropout\nlive at inference, N passes averaged). Under surrogate\nthe log tags rows [MLP surrogate] / [bagging, not MC]",
      "originalText": "ablations.py — the grid\n\nB0  single expert, raw softmax      uncalibrated floor\nB1  + temperature scaling          post-hoc calibration\nB2  MC dropout                     uncertainty by sampling\nB3  homogeneous 3× ensemble        ENSEMBLING alone\nB4  heterogeneous, uniform         HETEROGENEITY (vs B3)\nB5  heterogeneous, confidence-wt   self-reported conf.\nB6  heterogeneous, quality-routed  ROUTING (vs B4/B5)\n\neach row adds exactly one factor to the row above\n\nB2 is genuine MC dropout under --experts torch (dropout\nlive at inference, N passes averaged). Under surrogate\nthe log tags rows [MLP surrogate] / [bagging, not MC]",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r125",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "roundness": null
    },
