      "height": 175.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "evaluate.py — metrics\n\ncalibration    ECE · adaptive ECE · Brier · NLL\ngate quality   risk–coverage · AURC · E-AURC\noperational    risk @ 80% coverage, coverage @ 5/10% risk\nsignificance   paired bootstrap CI on ΔAURC\n\nE-AURC because raw AURC is bounded below by the error\nrate — subtracting the optimal curve isolates the\nconfidence RANKING",
      "originalText": "evaluate.py — metrics\n\ncalibration    ECE · adaptive ECE · Brier · NLL\ngate quality   risk–coverage · AURC · E-AURC\noperational    risk @ 80% coverage, coverage @ 5/10% risk\nsignificance   paired bootstrap CI on ΔAURC\n\nE-AURC because raw AURC is bounded below by the error\nrate — subtracting the optimal curve isolates the\nconfidence RANKING",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
