      "id": "t159",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 2975,
      "width": 366.59999999999997,
      "height": 178.75,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "TWO EXPERT FAMILIES, both retained:\n\n--experts torch\n    ResNet-50 / ViT-S/16 on 2-D slices, genuine\n    MC dropout for B2. The only family that is\n    EVIDENCE about CNN/ViT behaviour.\n\n--experts surrogate\n    scikit-learn MLPs, no torch needed. Runs\n    anywhere; fast iteration on the routing,\n    calibration and gate logic.",
      "originalText": "TWO EXPERT FAMILIES, both retained:\n\n--experts torch\n    ResNet-50 / ViT-S/16 on 2-D slices, genuine\n    MC dropout for B2. The only family that is\n    EVIDENCE about CNN/ViT behaviour.\n\n--experts surrogate\n    scikit-learn MLPs, no torch needed. Runs\n    anywhere; fast iteration on the routing,\n    calibration and gate logic.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
